SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

This license covers the source code in this repository: the Flipper Zero
remake it is based on (src/game/, see also src/game/LICENSE) and the code
written for the Lilka port. The remake was written from scratch from videos
of the original game; no Siemens code is used.

"Stack Attack" is a game originally made for Siemens mobile phones. This is an
unofficial fan project for the preservation of old mobile games. It is not
affiliated with, endorsed by or supported by Siemens or any current owner of
the original game. Names of the original game and phones belong to their
respective owners and are used only to identify the game being remade.

The firmware links the Lilka SDK, which is licensed under GPL-2.0.
